<title>USA: Transocean sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Transocean sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transocean Offshore Inc said on Thursday that its board of directors has approved a two-for- one stock split of Transocean's common stock.</p>
<p>The stock-split dividend will be payable on September 19, 1997 to shareholders of record on September 5, 1997, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Also, Transocean Offshore declared a cash dividend of $0.06 per share on the company's common stock prior to the stock split and payable on September 19, 1997 to shareholders of record on September 5, 1997.</p>
<p>The company's dividend of $0.06 per share prior to the stock split will be equivalent to $0.03 per share after the stock split.</p>
